                                               moves ≈ 4·m·n²                     if ≈ 8·m ≥ M and ≈ 8·n < M and ≈ B·kernel_syrk.i + 8·kernel_syrk.i < M and ≈ 8·n² + 8·m·n ≥ M
                                               moves ≈ 4·m·n²                     if ≈ 8·m ≥ M and ≈ 8·n ≥ M and ≈ B·kernel_syrk.i + 8·kernel_syrk.i < M and ≈ 8·n² + 8·m·n ≥ M
